OL,3,GNEWSAWhy bookshops are booming in the
OL,4,ATikTok age
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening your own book shop might be a
OL,7,Flofty daydream for some bookworms
OL,8,Flooking to escape their 9-5, but more
OL,9,Fand more people are making it a
OL,10,Freality.
OL,12,FAccording to the Booksellers
OL,13,FAssociation, the number of independent
OL,14,Fbook shops in the UK and Ireland is now
OL,15,Fat its highest level since 2012, with
OL,16,F1,086 stores in 2025 - up from a record
OL,17,Flow of 867 in 2016.
OL,19,FBut what is the reality of life as a
OL,20,Fsmall bookseller, competing with
OL,21,FAmazon, finding new customers, and
OL,22,Factually trying to make a profit?
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
